{
  "title": "Sodium\u2013glucose interaction provides no demonstrated incremental cognitive-score prediction across NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "In 1,290 NHANES 2011\u20132012 adults aged 60+ and 1,505 separately sampled 2013\u20132014 adults, a serum sodium\u2013glucose product added to flexible standard clinical/demographic and reported-osmolality predictors showed no demonstrated improvement in concurrent DSST prediction: target weighted MSE difference -0.035925 (-0.0213%); full source-plus-target PSU-bootstrap 95% interval [-0.813063, 1.514045] score-squared units. This does not establish equivalence or absence of physiological association.",
  "keywords": [
    "serum sodium",
    "glucose",
    "DSST",
    "NHANES",
    "incremental prediction",
    "negative result"
  ],
